      "value": "Created as a means to clean up battlefields, as the very nature of such a cleanup in a multi-species Republic is complex due to the variety of ailments that are capable of cross-species infection."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "多種多種共和制におけるそのようなクリーンアップの性質は、クロス種感染が可能なさまざまな病気のために複雑であるため、戦場をきれいにする手段として作成されました。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "The virus was once a simple organism, but mutated and gained sentience. At this point it becomes an aggressive prion capable of quantum relocation across dimensional wavelengths through sheer luck. Infecting people, it becomes known as GREG-771"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "ウイルスはかつて単純な生物だったが、突然変異し、感受性を得た。 この時点で、それは非常に幸運を通じて次元波長をまたいで量子移動が可能な攻撃的なプリオンになる。 人々に感染すると、それはグレッグ-771と呼ばれます。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/2",
      "value": "Mutating further, it gets loose. Upon its final mutation it begins to breed sentient parasites. These infect a host corpse, and latch onto its cerebellum as they mature. Once reaching maturty, the Parasite enters a pupae stage and forms a cocoon within the corpse."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/2",
      "value": "さらにミュータリングすると緩みます。 最終突然変異では、感覚的な寄生虫を繁殖させ始めます。 これらは宿主の死体に感染し、成熟するにつれて小脳に突き刺さる。 成熟すると、寄生虫は子犬の段階に入り、死体の中にコクーンを形成します。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/3",
      "value": "It devours the corpse during this transition, leaving behind a slimey outline matching that of the original host. Once this host corpse is digested, the Symbiote is birthed from the slime sack as a fully mature slime."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/3",
      "value": "この移行中に死体を消費し、元のホストと一致するスライム状のアウトラインを残します。 この宿主の遺体が消化されると、シンビオテは、完全に成熟した粘液として粘液袋から誕生する。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/4",
      "value": "These are immediately taken in by elder variants who teach them of their new lives and civilization, as their brains are fresh and new. They are fully capable of adult human reflexes from birth."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/4",
      "value": "これらは、彼らの脳が新鮮で新しいので、彼らの新しい生活と文明を彼らに教える高齢者の変種によってすぐに取り込まれます。 ヒトの成人反射を出生から完全に発揮します。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
